      "path": "crates/host-core/src/command_center/receipt_tests.rs",
      "reason": "The taken-over test expected accepted → conflicted, but the frozen shared C1 table forbids that transition. The test now expects CC_TRANSITION_INVALID and keeps the ledger-retention assertion."
    },
    {
      "path": "crates/host-core/src/command_center/reservation_tests.rs",
      "reason": "The taken-over test created a fourth enabled workspace, which the frozen three-workspace quota rejects. It now exercises the Host cap through a 37th admission into an existing workspace (the Host check runs first) and asserts the fourth enabled workspace is refused."
    },
    {
      "path": "crates/host-core/src/command_center/tests.rs",
      "reason": "The migration test created a file under temp_dir(), which this managed host denies for the test process; existing repo tempdir tests fail the same way. It now uses tempdir_in on the repository target scratch directory and still proves additive migration plus idempotence."
    }
